  ('Doctor of Philosophy (Engineering) by Prior Publication', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3035, '3 years', '["Jan","May","Sep","Feb"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy (Engineering) by Prior Publication at UCSI University is specifically designed for experienced researchers who have a substantial body of peer-reviewed work. This program allows candidates to obtain a doctoral qualification by showcasing the originality, significance, and impact of their existing research.

