  ('Advanced Diploma in Midwifery', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 5718, '1 year', '["Jan"]'::jsonb, 'The Advanced Diploma in Midwifery at UCSI University is a specialized program designed for registered nurses seeking to deepen their knowledge and skills in midwifery. This program focuses on providing advanced training in the care of women during pregnancy, childbirth, and the postpartum period.

