  ('Bachelor in Human Capital Management', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 6087, '3 years', '["Jan","May","Sep","Feb"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor in Human Capital Management (Honours) at UCSI University is designed to equip students with the strategic skills and practical knowledge necessary for effective people management in today’s dynamic business environment. The program covers key areas such as talent management, performance evaluation, organizational development, and employment law, blending academic theory with real-world application.

