  ('Diploma in Opticianry', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 3674, '3 years', '["Sep","Feb"]'::jsonb, 'The Diploma in Opticianry at UCSI University is a specialized program designed to equip students with the knowledge and skills needed to become proficient opticians. The course covers essential technical aspects of vision care, including the fitting, dispensing, and adjustment of ophthalmic glasses.

