  ('Diploma in Pharmacy', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 5584, '3 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Diploma in Pharmacy Program at UCSI University Malaysia prepares students to work as pharmacy assistants and technicians in the healthcare and pharmaceutical industries. It covers subjects like pharmaceutics, pharmacy practices, communication skills, healthcare management, and entrepreneurship. The program includes attachments in hospitals, community pharmacies, and industrial settings for practical experience. Graduates can pursue careers in various healthcare settings, supporting pharmacists in dispensing medications and ensuring their safe use.

