  ('Doctor of Philosophy', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3542, '3 years', '["Jan","May","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.) program in Science at our institution offers a comprehensive and dynamic research environment focused on a wide range of cutting-edge scientific inquiries. With a mission to advance knowledge and innovation, our faculty and students delve into diverse areas such as exploring Malaysia''s biodiversity for natural product development, studying the therapeutic potential of bioactive compounds from various sources, investigating genetic associations with diseases, and developing novel biotechnological solutions for environmental challenges. Through close mentorship, state-of-the-art research facilities, and ample funding opportunities, our Ph.D. students engage in high-impact research projects, contributing to both fundamental understanding and practical applications in science. The program is designed to foster intellectual creativity, professional development, and leadership skills, empowering graduates to become independent researchers poised to make significant contributions to scientific discovery and societal well-being.

