  ('Foundation in Science', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Foundation', 4959, '1 year', '["Jan","May","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Foundation in Science (Engineering) at UCSI University is designed to prepare students for a career in engineering, addressing the growing demands of the Fourth Industrial Revolution. This program provides a solid grounding in science, technology, engineering, and mathematics (STEM) subjects, ensuring a broad understanding of engineering fundamentals.

