  ('Graduate Certificate In Aesthetic Assistant With Wellness', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 4488, '1 year', '["Jan","May","Sep","Feb"]'::jsonb, 'The Graduate Certificate in Aesthetic Assistant with Wellness at UCSI University combines the fields of aesthetic assistantship and wellness, equipping graduates with the knowledge and skills necessary for careers in both industries. This program emphasizes evidence-based practices in aesthetics while providing exposure to recent advances in wellness.

