  ('Master of Education', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 10802, '1 year', '["Jan","May","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Education programme at UCSI University is intended to provide educators with research-based and practical skills, hence improving their professional practice and effect in the classroom and education business. The programme, which focuses on teaching techniques, curriculum building, and research competency, trains educators to adapt to changing educational landscapes and manage their positions in a knowledge-based economy. Students get vital insights and skills to excel as educators from experienced academics from prestigious local and worldwide institutions, promoting independent thinking, criticality, and problem-solving abilities that are required for success in a wide range of educational contexts.

