  ('Master of Science (Actuarial Management) Structure C', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 7926, '1 year', '["Jan","May","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Science (Actuarial Management) Structure C at UCSI University is designed to offer a comprehensive educational pathway for individuals looking to transition into the actuarial profession. Following the successful accreditation of its undergraduate Actuarial Science programs, this master''s degree elevates UCSI''s offerings in Actuarial Studies to the graduate education level, covering all topics related to the first four CAS/SOA exams.

