  ('Post-Basic Critical Care Nursing', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 0, '0.6 years', '["Jan","May","Sep","Feb"]'::jsonb, 'The Post-Basic Critical Care Nursing program at UCSI University prepares nurses for high-pressure critical care environments, equipping them with the skills and knowledge necessary to make crucial interventions that save lives. The curriculum emphasizes critical thinking, evidence-based practices, and patient-centered care, ensuring graduates can deliver effective critical care aligned with industry standards.

