  ('Postgraduate Diploma in Tertiary Teaching', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UCSI University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 4290, '1 year', '["Jan","May","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Postgraduate Diploma in Tertiary Teaching (PGDTT) at UCSI University is designed for both new and experienced educators, providing a platform to explore effective teaching and assessment methods. Participants will become critical, reflective practitioners and learn techniques to enhance both teaching and research capabilities.

The program emphasizes the integration of the latest technologies into academic practice, making classes more engaging and enjoyable. Students will also explore curriculum design tailored to specific educational outcomes while collaborating with inter-faculty colleagues on multidisciplinary and interdisciplinary projects.

Offering significant flexibility, the program is 70% online, allowing educators to learn from home, the office, or even a café, as long as they have internet access. Additionally, students have the opportunity to broaden their knowledge and cultural experiences through short study tours at the University of Melbourne and Durham University. This versatile program is designed to transform educators into more effective and dynamic teachers.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

Thank you  for submitting your form to us. We will contact you as soon as possible to assist you on your university journey.', '[{"year":"Semester 1","modules":["Critical Practices of Teaching and Learning in Higher Education","Assessment, Evaluation and Feedback in Higher Education","Learning with Technologies for Higher Education"]},{"year":"Semester 2","modules":["Curriculum Planning, Development and Evaluation","Effective Communication Skills and Group Dynamics","Mentoring and Reflective Practice for Higher Education"]}]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Lecturer\nTutor\nTrainer\nFacilitator\nEducational Training Consultant"]'::jsonb, 'Free', '​Master Degree(Level 7, Recognised by MOHE) in any field

