  ('Bachelor of Arts (Honours) in Interior Architecture', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Taylor''s University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 10384, '3.5 years', '["Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Arts (Honours) in Interior Architecture at Taylor''s University is a comprehensive degree programme that complies with the requirements set by the Board of Architects Malaysia (Lembaga Arkitek Malaysia - LAM). This programme is designed to equip students with the necessary skills and knowledge to excel in the field of interior architecture/design.

