  ('Bachelor of Biomedical Science', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Taylor''s University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 10857, '3.5 years', '["Feb","Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours) at Taylor''s University is a comprehensive programme that provides students with a strong foundation in the fields of medicine, health sciences, and biomedical science research. The programme is designed to expose students to the latest developments in these fields, equipping them with the knowledge and skills needed to pursue exciting career opportunities.

