  ('Bachelor of Fashion Design Technology', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Taylor''s University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 9300, '3 years', '["Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Fashion Design Technology (Honours) Program at Taylor''s University Malaysia stands out with its unique format. The program combines traditional design and sewing curriculum with technological components, enhancing both the learning experience and module contents. The degree in fashion design technology provides students with extensive knowledge in utilizing the latest technology for designing. It prepares them to become skilled fashion designers with a strong understanding of fashion technology in today''s dynamic industry.

