  ('Bachelor of International Events Management', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Taylor''s University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 9680, '3 years', '["Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of International Events Management (Honors) Program at Taylor''s University Malaysia is an award-winning program designed to cultivate versatile leaders in the dynamic events industry, who will be recognized as trendsetters in events management. The program equips students with functional and managerial skills, as well as knowledge in business, communication, culture and arts, events, and tourism studies. It prepares graduates to work globally with a strong international and local focus in the curriculum. The program is highly esteemed in the industry and has received the Business Events (BE) Education Excellence Award. It is also accredited as an International Centre of Excellence in Event Management.

