  ('Master in Applied Computing', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Taylor''s University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 11693, '1 year', '["Feb","Apr","Jun","Sep","Nov"]'::jsonb, 'The Master in Applied Computing (Bridging Module) at Taylor’s University is designed to foster innovation and cultivate the next generation of technology leaders. The programme aims to develop critical talent for the knowledge economy while enhancing academic-industry partnerships across various disciplines.

