  ('Bachelor of Accounting and Finance', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'APU University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 7678, '3 years', '["Mar","Jul","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'Embark on a transformative journey with APU University Malaysia Bachelor of Accounting and Finance (Honours) program. Explore a myriad of invaluable insights and skills, detailed below:

