  ('Doctor of Business Administration (DBA)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'APU University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 4165, '3 years', '["May","Aug","Dec"]'::jsonb, 'Embark on a transformative journey with APU University Malaysia Doctor of Business Administration program. Explore a myriad of invaluable insights and skills, detailed below:

