The programme comprises 2 pre-requisite modules (for non-Computing students), 10 coursework modules and a Project.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Specialist in field"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'Pass Matriculation / Foundation / STPM or equivalent.'),
  ('MSc in Software Engineering', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'APU University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 9240, '1 year', '["May","Aug","Dec"]'::jsonb, 'Embark on a transformative journey with APU University Malaysia MSc in Software Engineering program. Explore a myriad of invaluable insights and skills, detailed below:

Upon successful completion of the MSc in Software Engineering program, graduates will possess a comprehensive skill set and knowledge base enabling them to excel in various facets of the software engineering domain. This program is meticulously crafted to empower individuals to meet the evolving demands of the industry and make significant contributions to software development and innovation.

Firstly, graduates will be proficient in undertaking and effectively managing large-scale and complex software development projects. Through rigorous coursework and practical experiences, students acquire the necessary expertise to navigate the intricacies of project management, ensuring the successful delivery of software solutions within specified timelines and budgets.

Moreover, students will develop a keen understanding of reliability and quality considerations in software design. They will be adept at evaluating and incorporating quality metrics into the assessment of software systems, thereby enhancing the overall reliability and performance of software products.

Additionally, the curriculum emphasizes the importance of technology-based infrastructure in gaining a competitive edge in the business landscape. Graduates will appreciate how efficient technology infrastructure can drive organizational success and will be well-equipped to contribute to the strategic implementation of technology solutions within businesses.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Specialist in field"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'Pass Matriculation / Foundation / STPM or equivalent.'),
