  ('PhD in Finance', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'APU University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3725, '3 years', '["Feb","Mar","Apr","May","Jun","Jul","Aug","Sep","Oct","Nov","Dec"]'::jsonb, 'Embark on a transformative journey with APU University Malaysia PhD in Finance program. Explore a myriad of invaluable insights and skills, detailed below:

