  ('Bachelor in Computer Science (Artificial Intelligence) (Honours)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UNITEN University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 5720, '3 years', '["Jan","Jul","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor in Computer Science (Artificial Intelligence) (Honours) at UNITEN University is designed to provide students with a strong dual focus on core Computer Science and Artificial Intelligence. The program aligns with industry needs and professional standards, incorporating relevant certifications to ensure graduates are career-ready.

