The program also offers valuable industry exposure through internships and industrial training, supported by strong collaborations with leading technology companies. Students benefit from UNITEN’s connections with Tenaga Nasional Berhad, gaining experience in applying AI in energy, sustainability, and smart technologies—fields that are increasingly important in today’s world.

