  ('Master in Artificial Intelligence (By Coursework & Project)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UNITEN University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 8140, '1 year', '["Jan","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master in Artificial Intelligence (By Coursework & Project) at UNITEN University is designed to produce AI specialists equipped with advanced expertise, innovation, and leadership skills to drive the future of technology. This coursework-based program responds to the global demand for AI professionals by combining theoretical depth with practical, industry-aligned learning experiences.

The program covers essential AI areas, including machine learning, computer vision, natural language processing, reinforcement learning, and AI ethics, all supported by strong foundations in programming and research methodology. Students engage in advanced modules such as Advanced Artificial Intelligence, Algorithms and Programming in Python, and Advanced Machine Learning, gaining critical skills to design, implement, and manage AI systems across various industries.

The program concludes with a final project, allowing students to apply their knowledge to solve complex, real-world problems, ensuring they are well-prepared for the workplace upon graduation. The MAI program is benchmarked against leading universities, providing a world-class education at a highly competitive cost.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

Note: The project spans Semesters II and III, with submission and evaluation in Semester III.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Specialist in field"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'A Bachelor’s degree in Computing or related fields with a minimum CGPA of 2.50, as accepted by UNITEN Senate.

