  ('Master in Data Science (By Coursework & Project)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UNITEN University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 8140, '1 year', '["Jan","Jul","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master in Data Science (By Coursework & Project) at UNITEN University prepares students to excel in one of today''s most in-demand fields. This coursework-based program equips students with advanced knowledge and practical skills to transform complex data into meaningful insights that drive decision-making and innovation across various industries.

Blending strong theoretical foundations with hands-on, industry-driven experiences, the program reflects global best practices and is benchmarked against top universities worldwide. Students will master key areas, including data analytics, advanced machine learning, advanced text analytics, advanced data visualization, and programming with Python, while also developing robust research capabilities through dedicated methodology training.

The curriculum offers flexibility with electives such as natural language processing, data governance, and reinforcement learning, allowing students to customize their academic path according to their career ambitions. The program concludes with a practical final project, ensuring that graduates are well-prepared to apply their expertise to real-world challenges immediately upon completion.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

