  ('MSc in Public Health (Global Health)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Cyberjaya University Malaysia (UoC)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 8360, '1 year', '["Mar","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The MSc in Public Health (Global Health) program at the University of Cyberjaya (UoC) prepares graduates for careers as lecturers, researchers, and program managers in the public health and global health field. The program covers core disciplines such as health management, improving healthcare delivery, and health protection. It is designed for healthcare practitioners, researchers, and professionals in related fields. Graduates can pursue further specialization through a PhD or DrPH program to become eligible for gazettement as Public Health Specialists in Malaysia''s National Specialist Register (NSR).

