  ('Bachelor in Hospital Management', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4596, '3 years', '["Jan","May","Aug","Jan"]'::jsonb, 'MAHSA University’s Bachelor in Hospital Management (Hons) is a three-year degree program tailored for individuals aspiring to contribute to the health and well-being of individuals and society as a whole, but in administrative roles rather than as doctors, nurses, or other medical professionals.

