  ('Bachelor of Accounting', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 3747, '3 years', '["Jan","May","Aug","Jan"]'::jsonb, 'Graduates have the option to enter direct practice in either the public or private sector, or to pursue professional accountant certifications such as CPA (Certified Public Accountant), ACCA (Association of Chartered Certified Accountants), and CIMA (Chartered Institute of Management Accountants), while fulfilling work requirements through training at accounting firms. Accountants are among the most respected professionals, with their esteemed status in society remaining unchallenged.

