  ('Bachelor of Biomedical Sciences', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 6188, '4 years', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'MAHSA University’s Bachelor of Biomedical Sciences (Hons) is a four-year program designed for individuals pursuing a career in biomedical science, focusing on research and development, diagnostics, or production.

