  ('Bachelor of Civil Engineering with Honours', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 5170, '4 years', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Civil Engineering (Hons) is a four-year program developed in consultation with a panel of experts and approved by the Engineering Accreditation Council Malaysia (EAC) and the Malaysian Qualifications Agency (MQA). It aims to provide students with a comprehensive understanding and essential skills for the civil engineering industry, particularly in design and construction.

