  ('Bachelor of Pharmacy', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 8168, '4 years', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'Our Bachelor of Pharmacy (Hons) program, accredited by the Malaysian Qualifications Agency (MQA), provides the knowledge and practical skills necessary to pursue a career in pharmacy. Over the course of this four-year degree, you will learn the fundamental principles related to the use of medicines, including human physiology, the effects of medications on the body, and the processes involved in medicine development and design.

