  ('Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Architectural Technology', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 5258, '3.5 years', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'Architectural Technology is a relatively new discipline in Malaysia, grounded in the application of science, engineering, and technology, and closely aligned with industry practices. MAHSA University is set to be the pioneering institution in Malaysia to offer a program titled "Bachelor of Architectural Technology," which incorporates Building Information Modeling (BIM) and Green Technology.

