The Bachelor of Science in Islamic Finance at MAHSA University is a 3.5-year program developed in collaboration with university partners. It aims to produce graduates who are not only knowledgeable and skilled in Islamic finance but also demonstrate a high level of integrity along with sound social and personal qualities that will be valuable to their future organizations. Additionally, these graduates will exhibit leadership characteristics, striving to uphold the principles of Maqasid al-Shariah.

