  ('Diploma in Education', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 3949, '2.5 years', '["Jan","May","Aug","Jan"]'::jsonb, 'This is your first step toward a career in English language teaching. The Diploma in Education TESL is specifically designed for those interested in teaching English as a second language. The program aims to produce competent graduates with professional knowledge and exceptional teaching skills in the field of TESL.

