  ('Diploma in Nursing', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 3227, '3 years', '["Apr"]'::jsonb, 'The Diploma in Nursing program at MAHSA University Malaysia is a highly regarded 3-year course designed for SPM-leavers interested in caring for patients in hospitals, hospices, and emergency medical centers. Students study core medical subjects like anatomy, biology, pathology, pharmacology, and safety procedures, as well as support subjects including communication techniques, psychological support, English language, and computer technology.

