  ('Diploma in Quantity Surveying', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 4081, '2.5 years', '["Jan","May","Aug","Jan"]'::jsonb, 'The Diploma in Quantity Surveying equips learners with essential skills needed in various industries where Quantity Surveyors are required. The program aims to develop expertise in measurement, costing, construction technology, construction economics, and the legal aspects relevant to the profession. Students will explore future trends in the construction and property industries while acquiring the fundamental knowledge and skills necessary for entering the workforce. Upon completing this diploma, students will create a pathway toward achieving their Bachelor of Quantity Surveying, ultimately enabling them to become registered Quantity Surveyors.

