  ('Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Nursing', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3839, '3 years', '["Jan","May","Aug","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'MAHSA University’s Doctor of Philosophy in Nursing is a comprehensive, advanced postgraduate degree designed for qualified nurses seeking to pursue specialized nursing practice and enhance healthcare delivery.

As a research-based, multidisciplinary program, it aims to expand opportunities for students and the nursing profession as a whole, opening doors to advanced healthcare practices and interdisciplinary collaboration. This program prepares individuals to transform the nursing landscape, pioneer innovative techniques, drive change, assume leadership roles, and improve healthcare for individuals, communities, and the global population.

