  ('Master of Business Administration', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 6930, '1 year', '["Jan","May","Aug","Jan"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Business Administration (MBA) in Strategic Leadership is a specialized program aimed at developing leaders who can navigate complex challenges and drive long-term success for organizations.

