  ('Master of Information Technology', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4697, '2 years', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Information Technology (Hons) at MAHSA University is a three-year program designed in consultation with experts and approved by the Malaysian Qualifications Agency (MQA) This program offers four areas of specialization: Data Management, Game Computing, Mobile Computing, and Network Computing, allowing students to choose their preferred path to develop industry-specific technological skills

