  ('Postgraduate Certificate in Aesthetic Medicine', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MAHSA University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 6380, '1 year', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Postgraduate Certificate in Aesthetic Medicine at MAHSA University is designed for medical doctors seeking to deepen their knowledge of the basic medical sciences underlying aesthetic medicine and to adhere to best practices through evidence-based medicine (EBM)

