  ('Bachelor Materials Engineering', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTP University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 6353, '4 years', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Materials Engineering (Hons) program at UTP University Malaysia focuses on the relationship between material structures and properties. Students learn to design materials with specific properties and develop processing techniques. The program emphasizes strong fundamentals in Mathematics and Engineering principles. Students can specialize in elective packages, gain practical problem-solving experience, and complete an industrial internship. They also gain awareness of environmental, social, and ethical considerations. Core specializations include Advanced Computational and Modelling of Materials and Degradation and Failure of Materials.

