  ('Foundation in Science', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'SEGi University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Foundation', 4197, '1 year', '["Feb","Jun","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Foundation in Science Program at SEGi University Malaysia prepares students for higher education by providing them with the necessary knowledge, skills, and practical experience. The program focuses on applied sciences and serves as a solid foundation for those interested in pursuing degrees in Health Sciences, Engineering, and Computing. Successful completion of the program guarantees entry into high-quality degree programs offered by SEGI University Malaysia as well as select UK universities in collaboration with SEGI. The foundation program enables students to directly enter their chosen degree programs, ensuring a smooth transition from secondary to tertiary education.

